  "DivisionNotes": [
    "This module is an animation/visualization spec; it declares no new VARIABLES, only operators that build SVG output from EWD998ChanID's state.",
    "ToSVG and AnimSpec contain primed expressions or [][...]_vars constructs respectively, so they are listed in ActionDefNames; AnimSpec is also classified as a TemporalProperty because it uses the box-action form [][\\E n \\in Node: System(n)]_vars.",
    "AnimInv is a state predicate (Boolean, no primes, no temporal operator at the outer level).",
    "PrimedVariables corrected to only include the variable that actually appears primed in this module (inbox in Messages).",
    "VerificationTools is TLC because the spec is exercised under the TLC simulator/model-checker for trace generation."
  ]
